WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
01  Ask normally. Your request has a background. The answer stays separate from system activity.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
02  Understanding does not wait for the finish. A small optional note arrives during work, with a stable L-number.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
03  Ask about one insight without replacing the work. Send L-000001. This recorded explanation is scripted; no model is called.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
04  Keep a private memo. Empty Enter moves to the yellow Owner field. Your note is not sent to AI.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.000
05  Review a candidate, without losing your place. A choice appears in Agent. Owner keeps focus until you switch back.

6
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
06  Find and reuse only what matters. Green searches Owner. A title prefix and Tab insert a chosen reference.

7
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
07  A conversation, not a screen that resets. The next question joins the same conversation. Your notebook stays beside it.

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
08  Your pace. Your own notebook. Scroll the active side while the other keeps its place. No homework list.
